    {
      "definition": {
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "title": "Prompt caching — pulled for PR reviews (RC1-350)",
        "type": "group",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "background_color": "transparent",
              "content": "Cache reads are ~10x cheaper than fresh input tokens. **pr-review-agent ships `cache_control` since 2026-08-31** (RC1-350, deploy `6a50e40`): verified ~75% input-cost cut per review — turns 2+ send 1 fresh token each. Expect its line to hold well above zero; **a drop back toward 0% now means something volatile broke the prefix.** The other apps stay deliberately uncached (~1 call/day — the write premium would go unread). Data before 2026-08-31 evening is the pre-caching era.",
              "font_size": "14",
              "has_padding": true,
              "show_tick": false,
              "text_align": "left",
              "type": "note"
            },
            "id": 5602560165931865,
            "layout": {
              "height": 1,
              "width": 12,
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0
            }
          },
          {
