    {
      "definition": {
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "title": "Cost per review — pr-review-agent (RC1-395)",
        "type": "group",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "background_color": "transparent",
              "content": "One `pr_agent.review.cost_usd` point **per review**, priced at the end of the trace from all four token counts (cache writes 1.25x, reads 0.1x). Per review, not per call: the per-call figures above go *down* when the multi-agent flag replaces one long loop with six short calls, whether or not the review got cheaper. Thresholds from the RC1-393 corpus run — multi + 3-turn scout 18–45c, single loop 48c–$1.10 — so the monitor warns at $0.50 and alerts at $1.00 on p95 over a day; `mode:single` above 50c is the flag off. Tags: repo · mode · scout · verified · model.",
              "font_size": "14",
              "has_padding": true,
              "show_tick": false,
              "text_align": "left",
              "type": "note"
            },
            "id": 7539084937230686,
